{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05487","headline":"奉酬张洪州九龄江上见赠 · 孙翃","name":"奉酬张洪州九龄江上见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"受命谳封疆，逢君牧豫章。\n於焉审虞芮，复尔共舟航。\n怅别秋阴尽，怀归客思长。\n江臯枉离赠，持此慰他乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}